ate selling pressure as short-term traders exit stagnant positions, turning a modest pullback into a deeper correction.  4. **MSFT (Microsoft Corp.) — Bear Case / Vulnerabilities:**    - **Lagging Momentum & Oversold Pressure:** Trading at $484.39, MSFT is suffering the deepest pullback relative to its recent range and lags the peer group significantly in near-term momentum, with an RSI of 37.28 approaching oversold territory.    - **Persistent Selling Pressure:** The weak relative strength and downward trend indicate persistent institutional distribution or lack of near-term buying interest, raising the risk of further downside continuation before any durable bottom forms.  RESULT: Argued the bear case and vulnerabilities for the large-cap universe (NVDA, AAPL, AMZN, MSFT) based on the provided research without submitting any orders.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bear/4e65ad9825d1494c1cd91fd203635a32cab3478263fa98447924150315a9d212-20260923034027760805.json
